  ('coding', 'Recursion', 2, 'What does this code print?', array['5041', '0', '5040', '5039'], 2, 'f(7) = 7 × f(6) and so on down to f(1) = 1. Multiplied back up, that is 5040.', 50, 'coding-factorial-rec', '43bdc9a47baa0a0e', '{"c":"int f(int n) {\n  if (n <= 1) return 1;\n  return n * f(n - 1);\n}\n\nprintf(\"%d \", f(7));","cpp":"int f(int n) {\n  if (n <= 1) return 1;\n  return n * f(n - 1);\n}\n\ncout << f(7) << \" \";","java":"static int f(int n) {\n  if (n <= 1) return 1;\n  return n * f(n - 1);\n}\n\nSystem.out.print(f(7) + \" \");","python":"def f(n):\n    if n <= 1:\n        return 1\n    return n * f(n - 1)\n\nprint(f(7), end=\" \")","pseudo":"function f(n)\n  if (n <= 1)\n    return 1\n  end if\n  return n * f(n - 1)\nend function\n\nprint f(7)"}'::jsonb),
